<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S4.F13.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Fig. 13</span>: </span><span id="S4.F13.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Quantitative comparison of referring expression segmentation results using different resolutions of box-wise semantic descriptors.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
